1
00:01:37,490 --> 00:01:42,960
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:46,020
[Episode 29]

3
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:47,710
-If you have any complaints...
-Chunqing.

4
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:48,530
You can...

5
00:01:48,870 --> 00:01:49,430
Shut up!

6
00:01:53,360 --> 00:01:55,160
The concubines in the residence

7
00:01:55,310 --> 00:01:56,560
hated Xia Yingying

8
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:58,410
deeply,

9
00:01:58,479 --> 00:01:59,930
but towards Chunqing,

10
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,560
they were jealous.

11
00:02:01,760 --> 00:02:05,290
And Hu Wenzhuo's eldest brother,
as Eunuch Xia's subordinate,

12
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:08,590
had already begun
to investigate this matter.

13
00:02:08,870 --> 00:02:11,800
The result would definitely
be disadvantageous to Chunqing.

14
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,710
So,

15
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,560
I made a deal with the Hu family

16
00:02:15,990 --> 00:02:19,170
to let Chunqing leave the Xie Residence.

17
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:22,400
So,

18
00:02:23,400 --> 00:02:25,470
you forced my mother

19
00:02:25,590 --> 00:02:27,050
to leave the Xie Residence

20
00:02:27,150 --> 00:02:28,710
and your side for a second time

21
00:02:28,710 --> 00:02:29,680
for...

22
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:32,280
It was for her own good.

23
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:36,150
It was to protect her.

24
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,940
I thought if she left the Xie family,

25
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,260
this place of trouble,

26
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:43,150
she would be safe.

27
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,520
But I never expected

28
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,840
that she was already pregnant
at that time.

29
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:56,190
Lord Lu even reminded

30
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:59,470
that fire is forbidden for 3 days
during the Cold Food Festival.

31
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:01,860
and was afraid you two
wouldn't have enough to eat,

32
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:03,820
so he sent over some wheat cakes.

33
00:03:04,470 --> 00:03:06,190
♫ Wheat seedlings are green ♫

34
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,790
♫ Mugwort is sweet ♫

35
00:03:07,910 --> 00:03:10,970
♫ The Bodhisattva of the Lu family
spends the cold days ♫

36
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:13,950
But since things had come to this,

37
00:03:14,030 --> 00:03:16,090
I had to secretly

38
00:03:16,150 --> 00:03:18,560
-to take care of your life.
-It tastes good.

39
00:03:18,870 --> 00:03:21,840
This was the best protection

40
00:03:22,079 --> 00:03:23,800
I could give you.

41
00:03:26,750 --> 00:03:27,280
Mother,

42
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:28,150
have a bite.

43
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:31,630
Stop working so tirelessly.

44
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:34,190
-It's time to find Yunya a father.
-Old Madam,

45
00:03:34,190 --> 00:03:35,280
we should go.

46
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:38,520
Let's go quickly.

47
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,750
Old Madam.

48
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:57,800
Chunqing

49
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,030
harbored the rebel,

50
00:04:00,580 --> 00:04:02,160
the son of Shen Zhibai,

51
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,100
so her house was burned down
by the officials.

52
00:04:04,100 --> 00:04:04,680
She...

53
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:06,750
She

54
00:04:09,150 --> 00:04:09,880
couldn't...

55
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,840
She couldn't escape.

56
00:04:17,950 --> 00:04:19,269
I originally thought

57
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,070
the three of us

58
00:04:23,430 --> 00:04:25,120
still had plenty of time,

59
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:29,360
and I would definitely find a chance

60
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:33,580
to bring you and your mother back.

61
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:36,970
Even if I could only listen from afar

62
00:04:37,360 --> 00:04:39,070
and see that you were safe,

63
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:43,040
I would be satisfied.

64
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:45,200
But I never expected that

65
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:48,580
outside the alley
during the Cold Food Festival

66
00:04:53,390 --> 00:04:56,070
was the last time

67
00:04:56,680 --> 00:05:00,240
we would see each other in this life.

68
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,560
After that fire,

69
00:05:14,310 --> 00:05:15,800
I was sick for 3 days.

70
00:05:17,270 --> 00:05:18,510
Since then,

71
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:21,920
I became a buddhist and vegetarian.

72
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:24,760
In the past, I didn't believe in anything.

73
00:05:25,270 --> 00:05:26,730
I only believed in myself,

74
00:05:27,480 --> 00:05:30,480
and only believed in
the things that power and tactics

75
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,390
brought me.

76
00:05:33,270 --> 00:05:34,870
But after Chunqing died,

77
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,600
I was afraid.

78
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:42,270
I was afraid of the karma in the world.

79
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:45,240
I thought if I devoted myself
to chanting sutras,

80
00:05:46,390 --> 00:05:49,310
maybe I could
accumulate some trivial merits

81
00:05:50,600 --> 00:05:52,159
in exchange for Chunqing

82
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,409
to not to have such a miserable life

83
00:05:56,190 --> 00:05:58,070
in her next life.

84
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:00,800
Later,

85
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,600
you followed Granny Chen

86
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,870
and gradually grew up.

87
00:06:08,270 --> 00:06:10,070
Although you lived

88
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:13,240
a poorer life than in the Xie family,

89
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,270
it was peaceful.

90
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:18,420
Compared to a cruel grandmother like me,

91
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:22,240
she is more like your real grandmother.

92
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,870
So,

93
00:06:27,630 --> 00:06:29,480
I tried hard to restrain myself

94
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:32,750
from disturbing your life.

95
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,430
It was until that day...

96
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:40,000
Old Madam.

97
00:06:40,510 --> 00:06:42,040
Taoist priest Xin Zhen said

98
00:06:42,120 --> 00:06:43,240
finding a mascot

99
00:06:43,390 --> 00:06:47,120
can eliminate the frequent
strange occurrences in the Xie family.

100
00:06:47,950 --> 00:06:49,120
A mascot?

101
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:52,870
That is just

102
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:55,720
some tricks of a warlock.

103
00:06:58,830 --> 00:07:00,040
The mascot

104
00:07:01,390 --> 00:07:03,120
and the blood-written poem...

105
00:07:04,950 --> 00:07:07,320
were that girl's scheme?

106
00:07:14,070 --> 00:07:14,870
Yuejian.

107
00:07:16,510 --> 00:07:18,420
Actually, our Xie Residence

108
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:20,280
has fourth lady

109
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:22,480
who has been wandering outside.

110
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:25,160
Go and find

111
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:26,270
her whereabouts.

112
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:28,120
Yes.

113
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:34,920
This Qingyuan...

114
00:07:35,600 --> 00:07:36,390
I know.

115
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,480
That was all

116
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:41,159
carefully planned by you

117
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:43,800
to get into the Xie Residence.

118
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:46,060
Since you wanted to get in,

119
00:07:47,430 --> 00:07:48,800
I helped you.

120
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:52,390
Everything you went through
in the Xie Residence,

121
00:07:52,390 --> 00:07:53,750
I know it all.

122
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:58,390
That wicked Nanny Rong bullied you.

123
00:08:00,310 --> 00:08:01,870
So I found an excuse

124
00:08:02,870 --> 00:08:04,190
and took her life.

125
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,600
Young Master Li

126
00:08:08,360 --> 00:08:10,390
was sincere to you.

127
00:08:11,950 --> 00:08:13,600
I thought of ways

128
00:08:14,680 --> 00:08:16,510
to facilitate this marriage.

129
00:08:18,390 --> 00:08:20,040
And that Yan Rui,

130
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,680
Lord Yan...

131
00:08:23,870 --> 00:08:25,430
How could I not see

132
00:08:28,190 --> 00:08:30,310
his feelings for you?

133
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:35,669
Many people in the Xie family

134
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:38,090
saw you as a thorn in their side.

135
00:08:38,870 --> 00:08:39,840
If

136
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,600
Lord Yan protects you,

137
00:08:44,150 --> 00:08:46,270
it might be a way out.

138
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:47,960
I harbored

139
00:08:48,870 --> 00:08:51,360
the intention of playing along.

140
00:08:52,630 --> 00:08:54,910
But after you entered the Xie Residence,

141
00:08:55,720 --> 00:08:57,390
I secretly made up my mind.

142
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:01,750
I would do my best to protect you.

143
00:09:03,370 --> 00:09:06,680
I would never let what happened
to your mother

144
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:10,120
happen to you again.

145
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,580
No one is more heartbroken than me

146
00:09:16,870 --> 00:09:18,550
about your suffering.

147
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,670
But I had no choice.

148
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:25,080
This was all I could do.

149
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:31,670
This was all you could do?

150
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,220
If you hadn't insisted that night

151
00:09:37,870 --> 00:09:39,840
on exchanging a daughter for a son,

152
00:09:41,270 --> 00:09:42,320
how would there be

153
00:09:43,150 --> 00:09:45,380
all these subsequent sufferings

154
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:46,480
and bloodshed?

155
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:48,720
All of this

156
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:51,200
started because of you.

157
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:54,080
What did you do to make up for it?

158
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:56,870
What you did

159
00:09:58,080 --> 00:10:00,590
was just patching up

160
00:10:02,720 --> 00:10:04,750
your previous mistakes.

161
00:10:06,510 --> 00:10:08,370
You are just deceiving yourself.

162
00:10:13,750 --> 00:10:14,910
Qingyuan,

163
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,700
you don't understand.

164
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:19,600
You are still young.

165
00:10:20,010 --> 00:10:25,530
[Danyue Pavilion]

166
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:21,960
Before a woman marries,

167
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,930
she must do her best
for her maiden family.

168
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,390
After marriage,

169
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:31,530
she must do her best
for her husband's family.

170
00:10:31,790 --> 00:10:33,870
Since I married into the Xie family,

171
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,840
naturally,

172
00:10:36,270 --> 00:10:38,600
passing down the lineage is the priority.

173
00:10:39,550 --> 00:10:42,150
But women cannot inherit
the family business.

174
00:10:42,390 --> 00:10:44,720
This is a rule left by our ancestors.

175
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,440
It's not up to me.

176
00:10:48,870 --> 00:10:50,400
But your surname is not Xie.

177
00:10:51,510 --> 00:10:52,390
Your parents,

178
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:54,150
daughter,

179
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,420
and your blood relatives—

180
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,780
none of them are surnamed Xie.

181
00:10:59,510 --> 00:11:01,770
The world only knows you as Old Madam Xie,

182
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:04,480
calling you Old Madam Xie.

183
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:06,960
While your real name,

184
00:11:07,390 --> 00:11:08,600
Lu Lingshu,

185
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:11,320
is hidden in the cold bronze mirror,

186
00:11:11,870 --> 00:11:13,080
known to no one.

187
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:16,250
Those achievements you are so proud of

188
00:11:16,840 --> 00:11:17,600
eventually

189
00:11:18,790 --> 00:11:21,120
all became the title of the Xie Residence.

190
00:11:23,030 --> 00:11:24,870
Is this really what you want?

191
00:11:28,510 --> 00:11:29,670
You are wrong.

192
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:34,220
When people remember the Xie Residence,

193
00:11:36,030 --> 00:11:37,510
they remember me.

194
00:11:39,550 --> 00:11:41,030
My mind is made up.

195
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:44,960
I will use my old life

196
00:11:46,670 --> 00:11:48,070
to protect the Xie family

197
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,790
for one last time.

198
00:11:53,080 --> 00:11:54,480
This is my fate,

199
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:57,080
my destiny.

200
00:12:01,960 --> 00:12:03,420
Before you trade your life

201
00:12:04,270 --> 00:12:05,670
for the Xie family,

202
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,980
have you ever wondered

203
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,510
who exactly

204
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,670
killed my mother?

205
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,390
Wasn't it

206
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:25,630
because your mother harbored

207
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:28,240
her friend's orphaned child,

208
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,870
angering the imperial court

209
00:12:30,670 --> 00:12:32,730
and bringing disaster upon herself?

210
00:12:33,150 --> 00:12:33,910
No.

211
00:12:35,150 --> 00:12:36,680
Before the guards arrived,

212
00:12:36,790 --> 00:12:38,320
my mother was already dead.

213
00:12:48,360 --> 00:12:49,360
Before she died,

214
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:51,990
she wanted to meet you again.

215
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:54,150
I'll take you downstairs to play tomorrow.

216
00:12:54,150 --> 00:12:54,670
Sure.

217
00:12:54,790 --> 00:12:55,840
I saw there were

218
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,440
a lot of wild pheasants downstairs.

219
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,870
Those are wild ducks.

220
00:12:59,150 --> 00:13:00,720
No matter if they're pheasants or ducks,

221
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,600
let's go downstairs
and catch them tomorrow.

222
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,550
Sure.

223
00:13:03,550 --> 00:13:04,960
Let's get a net and catch a bunch.

224
00:13:04,960 --> 00:13:06,480
Who's still up so late?

225
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:09,360
You little rascal.

226
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,600
You're so naughty.

227
00:13:13,150 --> 00:13:14,000
Run,

228
00:13:14,360 --> 00:13:15,360
go to sleep early.

229
00:13:16,750 --> 00:13:17,510
Be a good boy.

230
00:13:17,510 --> 00:13:19,840
I'll make you lots of yummy food tomorrow.

231
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:21,000
Okay!

232
00:13:23,440 --> 00:13:25,130
You little rascal.

233
00:13:25,200 --> 00:13:26,150
I'll spank you.

234
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:29,050
You didn't even cover yourself properly.

235
00:13:54,270 --> 00:13:55,150
Little Loser.

236
00:13:55,790 --> 00:13:56,590
Little Loser?

237
00:14:16,790 --> 00:14:17,790
Lu Lingshu.

238
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:20,200
What should I call you?

239
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,240
Should I call you

240
00:14:22,390 --> 00:14:23,320
Old Madam,

241
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:25,870
[I respectfully address this letter to the dressing table of the revered Old Madame Xie.
I would not dare presumptuously refer to you as mother.]

242
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:25,080
or

243
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:26,960
Mother?

244
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,790
Today I finally realized

245
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:41,630
you didn't protect me

246
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,960
out of courtesy,

247
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:47,100
nor was it because
I am your daughter-in-law.

248
00:14:47,200 --> 00:14:49,000
It was a mother's

249
00:14:49,270 --> 00:14:52,550
love for her flesh and blood,

250
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:54,910
and her way to make amends.

251
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:05,150
But what kind of reason

252
00:15:05,550 --> 00:15:07,270
made it worth doing this?

253
00:15:08,030 --> 00:15:09,910
If you cared about me,

254
00:15:10,670 --> 00:15:12,870
how could you bear to abandon me

255
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:17,960
and hand me over
to that alcoholic, gambling,

256
00:15:18,150 --> 00:15:20,840
notorious beast,

257
00:15:20,840 --> 00:15:22,600
making me call him

258
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:24,080
father?

259
00:15:25,670 --> 00:15:28,910
I was treated like an animal
at his command since childhood.

260
00:15:28,910 --> 00:15:30,360
While still young,

261
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:33,220
I was reduced to making a living
in a theater troupe.

262
00:15:33,390 --> 00:15:34,960
On top of that,

263
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:37,390
the silver I worked so hard to earn

264
00:15:37,390 --> 00:15:39,590
would be taken away by him immediately.

265
00:15:40,150 --> 00:15:43,280
His creditors harassed me every day.

266
00:15:43,550 --> 00:15:45,150
Even he himself,

267
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:47,750
more than once when he was drunk,

268
00:15:47,910 --> 00:15:50,440
had filthy thoughts about me.

269
00:15:51,630 --> 00:15:52,670
And you?

270
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:55,530
You stayed deep within the Xie Residence,

271
00:15:55,630 --> 00:15:57,720
behind countless doors,

272
00:15:58,120 --> 00:16:00,360
just watching me.

273
00:16:00,790 --> 00:16:02,870
Watching me covered in mud

274
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,840
and enduring all kinds of humiliation,

275
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:08,150
yet never revealing a hint of the truth.

276
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:11,080
To keep it so watertight,

277
00:16:11,670 --> 00:16:13,630
it must not have been easy for you.

278
00:16:26,270 --> 00:16:28,320
I should have been grateful

279
00:16:28,750 --> 00:16:30,600
for your kindness.

280
00:16:31,150 --> 00:16:32,790
But right now,

281
00:16:33,200 --> 00:16:35,750
how can I not feel hatred?

282
00:16:36,270 --> 00:16:39,080
Yet I can't bring myself
to hate all of this.

283
00:16:41,450 --> 00:16:47,140
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

284
00:16:46,750 --> 00:16:48,870
The real murderer of my mother

285
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:53,270
♪ Waiting for rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

286
00:16:51,440 --> 00:16:52,960
is your fake son,

287
00:16:53,340 --> 00:16:59,010
